%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                          <tr>\r\n                            <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\" class=\"aligned-bullets bullets-pb-12\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #191919; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-top: 4px; width: 100%;\">\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">Hi Luano,</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">How can talent teams give every leader just-in-time, one-on-one coaching before high-stakes conversations?</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">LinkedIn Learning&rsquo;s new AI-powered role play tool lets leaders practice challenging discussions in a realistic, low-pressure setting, then receive personalized, actionable AI feedback after each session.</p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">&zwnj;<br></p>\r\n                              <p style=\"margin: 0px;\">It&rsquo;s a fast, scalable way to strengthen leadership skills and drive stronger development outcomes this year. Check out how AI-powered role play can help you meet the speed of today\'s workplace needs.</p>\r\n                                \r\n                            </td>\r\n                          </tr>\r\n                        </table>\r\n                      </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                  </table>\r\n                </td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n                \r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td width=\"100%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"left\">\r\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\r\n                