 pet plan.\r\n\r\nGET A QUOTE (\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526890\r\n)\r\n\r\n*Discounts are tiered and plan dependent.\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526891\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526892\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526893\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526894\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526895\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://oneplan.evlink21.net/servlet/link/87581/678722/146261380/2526896\r\n)',1756980006000),('19914490418406f2','AutoTrader <newsletter@autotrader.co.za>','Audi A3 Sportback: Still the benchmark?','Thu, 04 Sep 2025 12:12:35 +0200','Audi A3 Sportback review, Suzuki Grand Vitara 30-day review, New engines for Toyota Supra and Golf R? Tata Motors launches an assortment of affordable new cars in SA: Punch, Curvv, and Tiago, Mini','Audi A3 Sportback review, Suzuki Grand Vitara 30-day review, New\r\nengines for Toyota Supra and Golf R? Tata Motors launches an\r\nassortment of affordable new cars in SA: Punch, Curvv, and Tiago,\r\nMini Cooper John Cooper Works review, Nissan Navara Stealth Re\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325875\r\n)\r\n\r\nHaving trouble seeing this email? View It Online (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325876\r\n)\r\n\r\nAudi A3 Sportback TFSI Black Edition (2025) - Review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325877\r\n)\r\n\r\nAudi’s A3 Sportback offers sexy S line looks and a sporty cabin,\r\nbut is dated in some respects. Would you be willing to forgo some\r\nmodern touches for something that drives this well and looks this\r\ngood? READ REVIEW (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325878\r\n)\r\n\r\nView all automotive news (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325879\r\n)\r\n\r\nAudi A1 (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325880\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325881\r\n)\r\n\r\nNew engines for Toyota Supra and Volkswagen Golf R? (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325882\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325883\r\n)\r\n\r\nNews of a V8-powered Toyota Supra and a 5-cylinder Golf R sounds\r\nhighly unlikely in a world of downsizing.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325884\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325885\r\n)\r\n\r\nTata Motors launch Tiago: One of SA\'s cheapest cars (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325886\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325887\r\n)\r\n\r\nTata Motors has released pricing for the Tiago. Here’s what we\r\nknow so far.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325888\r\n)\r\n\r\nMini Cooper John Cooper Works (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325889\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325890\r\n)\r\n\r\nNissan Navara 2.5DDTi Stealth 4x4 (2025) Video Review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325891\r\n)\r\n\r\nWe grab the keys to the Nissan Navara in Stealth guise to\r\ndetermine if it is still a good option in today\'s marketplace.\r\n\r\nWatch now (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325892\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325893\r\n)\r\n\r\nCannonball Run Africa 2025 in the Mercedes-AMG SL63\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325894\r\n)\r\n\r\nWe took part in the 2025 Cannonball Run Africa in the\r\nMercedes-AMG SL63! Here’s how it went.\r\n\r\nWatch now (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325895\r\n)\r\n\r\nSuzuki Grand Vitara 2025 Review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325896\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325897\r\n)\r\n\r\nDouble-cab bakkies in SA: The real cost of owning a Hilux,\r\nRanger, or D-Max (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325898\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325899\r\n)We\'ve calculated ownership costs for SA\'s three most popular\r\ndouble-cab bakkies.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325900\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325901\r\n)\r\n\r\nPricing for Tata\'s Curvv revealed! (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325902\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325903\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325904\r\n)\r\n\r\nTata\'s latest model introduction is the Curvv, a mid-size\r\ncrossover SUV with a sloping roofline. We have all the info!\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325905\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325906\r\n)\r\n\r\nIs your Hyundai Palisade costing you too much? (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325907\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1339652/362509214/7325908\r\n)The Hyundai Palisade is the Korean manufacturer\'s SUV halo\r\nmodel, bu