mail&utm_campaign=launch_aug25_github&utm_content=launch_img1>\r\n\r\nBuild on your skills as a developer\r\n\r\n\r\nUnderstand how and when to use GitHub Copilot and ways you can incorporate it \r\ninto your workflow.\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/learn/paths/github-copilot-certification?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=launch_aug25_github&utm_content=launch_img2>\r\n\r\nGet ready for the certification exam\r\n\r\n\r\nFamiliarize yourself with GitHub Copilot features, plus responsible AI \r\npractices, privacy fundamentals, and more.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLearn more about GitHub Copilot and how to prepare for this certification on \r\nthe blog\r\n\r\n\r\nRead now \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/resources/blog/github-copilot-certification-how-to-prepare?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=launch_aug25_github&utm_content=launch_blog_cta>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nView Web Version \r\n<https://itr.links.codecademy.com/s/vb/Mwk1nZjzYjgiDUWcHxyDYfms-LK-PGEuSAZDNgBizQTu_FbEbQB5qTCdIF-tZyjq7XYGCiYkmFpzPaJr0sMXnu4HFY6JWqy8jh0vj8T85Vp1_5Nzz0a5n-5UJyeNb8zXMQO4vvzD7wGl/gn7AgNek85wvrFIaeNY1K0EUcf4hVvD1/12>\r\n |Email Preferences \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/account/mail_settings?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email>\r\n |Unsubscribe \r\n<https://itr.links.codecademy.com/s/u/JeWAK8wk8OJtsKBKKk0m_3zW2OCl4zYrqm7u9tbliiswFs1Zpxye9ckJKMzqNqtibzqR-asaMpeuBmRuwH3KruhPp94x0c-3DREYQi_zgHj6EAuq-55CMEuFSAU8O_79EjjtW_nR0Ijqu2BFn5olW9TRh1uBVqYtjCMPkp-5dVtZLPO4GnLom3oqpVrZOwLFEqrc0He0LQ6DeXhdAxZi2hK1dMNJ9Uuz/IfzcDgS1ACJpQYUXe5CYdKe5TG6iYRHY/12>\r\n |Privacy Policy \r\n<https://www.codecademy.com/policy?utm_source=iterable&utm_medium=email>\r\n\r\nCopyright Codecademy. All rights reserved. \r\n\r\n300 Innovative Way, Suite 2210, Nashua, NH 03062\r\n\r\n',1756994669000),('19915805c700a51c','Curtis Coatman <linkedin@em.linkedin.com>','Hi Luano from LinkedIn Premium','Thu, 04 Sep 2025 09:12:36 -0700','Your