 from R400, Umbrellas from R250.)*\r\n\r\n[ Shop Outdoor Deals](https://www.gumtree.co.za/s-garden-braai/v1c9182p1)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Find Fresh Furniture**\r\n========================\r\n\r\nGive your living space a new look without the new price tag. \r\n\r\n*(Couches from R1,500, Coffee Tables from R400, Bookshelves from R300)*\r\n\r\n[ Search Furniture](https://www.gumtree.co.za/s-furniture/v1c9181p1)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Make Spring Cleaning a Breeze**\r\n=================================\r\n\r\nMake spring cleaning a breeze with a little help from these bargains. \r\n\r\n*(Vacuum Cleaners from R500, Washing Machines from R1,800, Microwaves from R350)*\r\n\r\n[ Find Appliances](https://www.gumtree.co.za/s-home-appliances/v1c9184p1)\r\n\r\n\r\n*Gumtree data, 2025*\r\n\r\n\r\n**Check out what\'s new on Gumtree...**\r\n====================================== \r\n[ Browse More Deals On Gumtree](https://www.gumtree.co.za/s-all-the-ads/v1b0p1?product.escrowFeature=enabled)\r\n\r\n\r\n[**Search**](https://www.gumtree.co.za/)** |  **[**Post**](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)** |  **[**FAQs**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/portal/en/kb/basics)** |  **[**Contact**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/)\r\n\r\n\r\nThis email has landed in your inbox because you\'ve subscribed to receive emails from Gumtree.\r\n\r\nIf you\'d rather not receive anything else from us in future, that\'s fine. You can unsubscribe [**here**](https://r.mkt1.hello.gumtree.co.za/mk/un/v2/sh/WCPxRrWByckTgOSQFZh3NGCbwzmVNlX3/9vjKL3ixsi6-)**.**\r\n\r\nAny questions? Feel free to [**contact us.**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n[**Update Preferences**](https://www.gumtree.co.za/account/preference) | [**Privacy Policy**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/portal/en/kb/articles/gumtree-privacy-policy) | [**Terms of Use**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/portal/en/kb/articles/gumtree-terms-of-use)\r\n\r\nCopyright © 2025 | Gumtree South Africa (Pty) Ltd.\r\n\r\n',1757060062000),('1991975cdf339cb1','\"Taylor D