  ﻿ ͏ ‌     ﻿ ͏ ‌     ﻿ ͏ ‌     ﻿\r\n\r\nSeptember 2025\r\n\r\nIntroducing\r\nthe Polygon MCP server:\r\nAn LLM\'s connection to the market\r\n\r\n( https://github.com/polygon-io/mcp_polygon )\r\n\r\nMarket data shouldn\'t be hard for AI to access\r\nUse the full Polygon.io API with our new MCP server\r\n\r\nLearn More → ( https://github.com/polygon-io/mcp_polygon )\r\n\r\nMarket data meets AI: unleash new possibilities\r\n\r\nBuilt by the Anthropic team, MCP servers ( https://www.anthropic.com/news/model-context-protocol ) act as a sort of USB plug for agentic workflows. I t\'s all about simplifying your data exploration with high-quality, institutional-grade information – now accessible to your AI tools and applications like never before. Clone the repo ( https://github.com/polygon-io/mcp_polygon ). Talk to the market.\r\n\r\nAll asset classes\r\n\r\nFrom equities to crypto, the MCP server grants you direct access to all Polygon.io market data through a single interface.\r\n\r\nSeamless integration\r\n\r\nBuilt on the open Model Context Protocol, the MCP server turns Polygon’s API into a suite of AI-ready tools - Over 35 in total.\r\n\r\nQuick setup, instant access\r\n\r\nGetting started with the Polygon.io MCP server is lightning-fast. It’s a lightweight Python service with no complicated setup – just your API key and you’re ready to go.\r\n\r\nOpen-source, no extra cost\r\n\r\nThe MCP server is available to all Polygon.io users at no additional charge – if you have an API key, you’re all set.\r\n\r\nMore from our blog\r\n\r\nSee all ( https://polygon.io/blog )\r\n\r\n( https://polygon.io/blog/creating-stock-market-reports-using-open-ais-gpt-5-and-agent-sdk-with-the-polygon-io-mcp-server-in-under-200-lines-of-code )\r\n\r\n19 August\r\n\r\nGPT-5 + Polygon.io MCP server ( https://polygon.io/blog/creating-stock-market-reports-using-open-ais-gpt-5-and-agent-sdk-with-the-polygon-io-mcp-server-in-under-200-lines-of-code )\r\n\r\nDeep dive stock market queries using th