-e285c3bc8839 https://cm.to/fhDuYpwp Hi Luano van Eck ,\r\n\r\nImagine this: It’s 2027. You’re not just analysing data - you’re leading the way in data-driven decision-making. How? You invested in a growth mindset today.\r\n\r\nAt Regenesys, our Postgraduate Diploma in Data Science (PDDS)\r\n\r\nprogramme doesn’t just teach you to work with data - it trains you to master it, providing the technical expertise and strategic thinking needed to excel in the data science field.\r\n\r\nHere’s how the PDDS helps you build a growth mindset:\r\n\r\nMaster data analysis, machine learning, and computational techniques\r\n\r\nSolve real-world challenges with hands-on, practical experienceLearn from industry experts and collaborate with like-minded peersPrepare for data-driven roles across industries like tech, finance, healthcare, and more\r\n\r\nPDDS Programme Details:\r\n\r\nNQF Level: 8\r\n\r\nDuration: 1 Years\r\n\r\nStudy Mode: Online\r\n\r\nCredits: 135\r\n\r\nRemember, the world of data is evolving fast. Learn to adapt now, and you’ll stay ahead in your career. So, stop imagining - start building.Apply for the Postgraduate Diploma in Data Science today.https://cm.to/pv2A3ar7\r\n\r\nRegenesys Education, 165 West Street, Sandown, Sandton, Johannesburg, Gauteng 2031. Click here if you’d like to opt out of future emailshttps://www.cm.com/en-gb/app/email-campaigns/unsubscribe/5f1860ed-9d10-4d50-97a7-e285c3bc8839',1757154817000),('1991efd066e691f7','ReversePhone <support@email.reversephone.com>','Don’t let them hide behind a username, search now!','Sat, 06 Sep 2025 06:25:22 -0600','Put your mind at ease. Reversephone Try our people search tool! Hello, Whether you&#39;ve struck up an internet friendship with a stranger or downloaded a dating app, possibly learning who&#39;s really','\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.reversephone.com/?qs=8727992a6b233de70c938b6c83be298099776c34420a9f1607c4490d7c16054b5d8b7297310ee7033ccf26efc0525a315fe507ac8588ec7f52923f7dcb450e0a \r\n\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.reversephone.com/?qs=8727992a6b233de74f936d47b162be4289855e9d14d05de342d71d42215b47103431c05706ffb06113702d444f45b03edbd8dbf9661be3f05a7adb76cffebcca \r\n\r\n  \r\nTry our people search tool!\r\n \r\n \r\n\r\nHello, \r\n\r\n\r\nWhether you\'ve struck up an internet friendship with a stranger or downloaded a dating app, possibly learning who\'s really behind that online profile may help you figure out whether this person is worth your time.\r\n\r\n\r\nSure, there are plenty of like-minded people looking for romance online, but the reality is there are also scammers looking for their next victim.\r\nWith ReversePhone, you could potentially: \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n •\r\n Search for a person\'s true identity \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n •\r\n Double check the information on their social profiles \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n •\r\n Explore the person\'s real name, age and address \r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n •\r\n Check to see if they may have a criminal record \r\n \r\n\r\nThe world of online dating can be fun&ndash;if you take measures to better protect yourself.\r\n\r\nhttps://click.email.reversephone.com/?qs=8727992a6b233de74f936d47b162be4289855e9d14d05de342d71d42215b47103431c05706ffb06113702d444f45b03edbd8dbf9661be3f05a7adb76cffebcca \r\nSEARCH A USERNAME \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n \r\nWe\'ll be sad to see you go, but you can \r\nhttps://click.email.reversephone.com/unsub_center.aspx?qs=354a7a6f8fe09dff99cfdf5b5795dc6a04cfec10b32e8c64c7c9dbd56aefd393928808e2870452b48d7794143b8ca88c042335b92c9a411f6634157b17b8e3f832bcf5686a384c13 \r\nunsubscribe  from promotional emails.\r\n \r\nDisclaimer: The information contained in any report and on our website is not necessarily 100% accurate, complete or up to date, nor a substitute for your own due diligence, especially concerning such sensitive items as criminal history, relatives, mortgages and liens. Our data comes from a wide variety of sources, but some municipalities and jurisdictions are slow to report and 