ols – Share your baby camera’s access with \r\ncaregivers across locations, choose from different levels of access, so your \r\nprivacy controls rest with you!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGo Handsfree - Use your home or phone’s voice assistant to invoke \r\nfunctionality on the app\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVideo History Storage - Store and download every cute moment captured by your \r\ncamera when you’re busy or at work. Store footage for up to 10 days with a \r\nHubbleClub Premium subscription\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBabyZone -  Access to unlimited editable Babyzones – perfect for your active, \r\ngrowing child\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nVideo Sleep Diary – View your baby’s activities from the last 24 hours in one \r\nplace\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n In addition, enjoy full access to our library of soothing sleep content and \r\nentertaining stories plus more tools and insights that help make parenting so \r\nmuch simpler – to give you the peace of mind you deserve.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore HubbleClub Premium today. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUnlock HubbleClub Premium for 2 weeks \r\n<https://club.hubbleconnected.com/subscriptionpromo?source=email> \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nQuestions?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nReach us here <https://hubbleconnected.com/pages/contact2>\r\n\r\n\r\nWant more? Check out our socials \r\n\r\n\r\n <https://www.instagram.com/hubble.connected/> \r\n<https://www.facebook.com/HubbleConnects> \r\n<https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC99WsxGEojdnQiyk_ytn0xg> \r\n<https://twitter.com/Hubble_Connect>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nClick here to unsubscribe. \r\n<https://links.iterable.com/e/encryptedUnsubscribe?_r=a42b28e070c84d51a04be7845e57fffe&_s=0a1aeaf6fb354413b14eb8db40433bf9&_t=ruPYq4CrDDySwmvWwFq2YPwT6yl9loB7wQw7w_UJHHbtIvn9w_P0BRHCjNjMKXfzUBrmLVIgDBDmaiK619FCIFFU7g0tcT-nh_diVl06WAw%3D>\r\n',1757182545000),('19920d08999627d9','Kim at Adzuna <no-reply@adzuna.co.za>','31 New OIL STORAGE WAREHOUSE SUPERVISOR jobs in , be the first to apply!','Sat, 6 Sep 2025 20:56:00 +0000','Adzuna Latest job matches for 