ser Oracle Launches MFA In September 2025, Oracle will begin adding Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) to all Oracle owned','Action Required: Oracle Launches MFA      \r\nOracle <https://www.oracle.com/index.html?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&elqTrackId=2fa355f791ef4385a2211b3fd96907c4&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=644213&elqak=8AF5F303DAD38174625C79BDBB2CAFD751B9596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>      \r\nView this message in a Web browser <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652875&elqTrackId=f2923f70f57143ef942f60e3cce7d0fe&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5764366D59E12F4CC9AC2F2F27435D606596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>          \r\n\r\n\"Oracle Logo\"            \r\n\r\n\"Oracle Launches MFA\"         \r\n\"Oracle Launches MFA\"        \r\n\r\nOracle Launches MFA              \r\n\r\nIn September 2025, Oracle will begin adding Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) to all Oracle owned portals.              \r\n\r\nWatch Video <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652849&elqTrackId=fea74517a1be404888f9d498bff3df07&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF58412E29547128107CB05C26566767E8E596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>                   \r\n\r\nMFA is a quick extra step to keep your account—and data—safer.              \r\n\r\nWhy MFA?\r\n*Stops unauthorized logins—even if your password is known.\r\n*Easy setup in under 5 minutes. \r\n\r\nHow will this affect you? \r\n*MFA adds an extra layer of security by requiring a second verification step when signing into Oracle owned portals (like Cloud Customer Connect, My Oracle Support, Oracle Customer Center, etc.)\r\n*This will not affect products purchased from Oracle.\r\n*MFA helps prevent unauthorized access even if your account password is compromised.\r\n*You will use MFA each time you log in to any Oracle owned applications. \r\n\r\nHow to prepare: \r\n*Once enabled, you will be prompted to enroll in MFA upon your first login at any Oracle portal. Watch this video <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652849&elqTrackId=b8796453182b4ec2af89ceff11876ed0&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF59641138A4EC2C6347DDCE8262BA1AE45596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189> to see the setup process.\r\n*Follow the on-screen guide to choose your preferred MFA method (Oracle Mobile Authenticator, Mobile SMS or email ID-based One-Time Password), enter details, and verify your code.\r\n*Oracle Mobile Authenticator (OMA) is available on Windows <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652606&elqTrackId=bd8b4368ad33428fba9c340f19db9292&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF53FB753DB2912267978A7C3C2046CBC3D596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>, Android <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652605&elqTrackId=60dcad404b62440cb9d85d4e2cd142fd&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5BBBDBD2CE9576EB18F6830BC84BE479D596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>, and Apple <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652604&elqTrackId=c8625664301d4cc8bdbda672424aebb0&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF5B0412AFDE60EC80448AE96E6FF140BD7596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>\r\n*That’s it—next login you’ll enter your password plus complete your MFA method of choice. \r\n\r\nNeed help? \r\n*Setup Guide and FAQs <https://app.response.oracle-mail.com/e/er?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&s=1973398186&lid=652879&elqTrackId=9da815441a1b411fa1b46b469abdfe86&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqak=8AF55F7073B21DEAB8D5197516AEE917DC7B596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>\r\n\r\nThank you for helping us keep everything secure! \r\n\r\nOracle Identity and Security Team              \r\n\r\n<https://go.oracle.com/honeypotmetrics?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001&elqTrackId=0c60f0b63a414e8db8ef4516a6b1b9ed&elq=674dca8bba774f679781e2d2bc687fa4&elqaid=268574&elqat=1&elqCampaignId=644213&elqak=8AF5804F34E3A86BCAFCDBAE188677A7F61B596038EE385C3421DFF5340057530189>            \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms of Use and Privacy <https://www.oracle.com/legal/privacy/index.html?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001> | Contact Us <https://www.oracle.com/corporate/contact/global.html?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001>   \r\n                      \r\nYou are receiving this communication as you are the designated support contact and may not unsubscribe from receiving Oracle Critical Patch Updates, System and Contract communications. If you are no longer a customer, click here <https://go.oracle.com/LP=85558?elq_mid=268574&sh=2432333327283121333327303131263235353425273622292630282435343634&cmid=CORP250829P00035C00001> to update your status.     \r\n                    \r\nCopyright © 2025, Oracle and/or its affiliates. All rights r