YkctkV3YceHkQMKkOssfGdenOdL4ROYvnKszhUvAkXiTfZQZzEMSfgiabQgWJlk6KcfC6M7sqNlnYKIGU9ePV68wTNYr0ij89k-2BSYejnGA6-2FKOVCjRvD4UoNZfjhtErFWU5DY0Z2V5cYx6D7pd1W-2B-2FTmedpdtBwPQ0-2BdukHLloiaigPO-2BAkESIcTuLFo9ZA-3D\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" border=\"0\" style=\"height:1px !important;width:1px !important;border-width:0 !important;margin-top:0 !important;margin-bottom:0 !important;margin-right:0 !important;margin-left:0 !important;padding-top:0 !important;padding-bottom:0 !important;padding-right:0 !important;padding-left:0 !important;\"/></body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n',1757318761000),('19928a303ef47143','GitHub <noreply@github.com>','[GitHub] A Google identity was just linked to your GitHub account.','Mon, 08 Sep 2025 02:23:15 -0700','Social identity added Hey Omega130920, A new Google social identity was just linked to your GitHub account from the email address luanoveck@gmail.com. This means you can now sign in to GitHub using the','  Hey Omega130920,\r\n\r\n  A new Google social identity was just linked to your GitHub account from the email address luanoveck@gmail.com.\r\n\r\n  This means you can now sign in to GitHub using the Google account associated with that email address.\r\n\r\n  To see this and other security events for your account, visit https://github.com/settings/security-log\r\n\r\n  If you did not initiate this action or believe your account has been compromised, it is a good idea to review\r\n  your active sessions and all passkeys associated with your account or consider enabling two-factor authentication.\r\n\r\n  Thanks,\r\n  The GitHub Team\r\n',1757323395000),('19928a313fd29269','GitHub <noreply@github.com>','[GitHub] A third-party OAuth application has been added to your account','Mon, 08 Sep 2025 02:23:19 -0700','Hey Omega130920! A third-party OAuth application (ngrok.com) with user:email scopes was recently authorized to access your account. Visit https://github.com/settings/connections/applications/','Hey Omega130920!\r\n\r\nA third-party OAuth application (ngrok.com) with user:email scopes was recently authorized to access your account.\r\nVisit https://github.com/settings/connections/applications/e3ab4045e762cd114437 for more information.\r\n\r\nTo see this and other security events for your account, visit https://github.com/settings/security-log\r\n\r\nIf you run into problems, please contact support by visiting https://github.com/contact\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nThe GitHub Team\r\n\r\n',1757323399000),('19928a3afdabe4c4','ngrok <contact@ngrok.com>','Password reset for ngrok.com','Mon, 08 Sep 2025 09:23:59 +0000','Someone requested a password reset for your account luanoveck@gmail.com on ngrok.com. If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email. Your account doesn&#39;t support a password','\r\nSomeone requested a password reset for your account luanoveck@gmail.com on ngrok.com.\r\n\r\nIf you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email.\r\n\r\nYour account doesn\'t support a password reset because it only uses OAuth login.\r\nPlease use one of the following links to log in to your account:\r\n\r\n\r\nLog in with Google account \"luanoveck@gmail.com\" at https://dashboard.ngrok.com/login/google.\r\n\r\n',1757323439000),('19928d74296ca684','AutoTrader <newsletter@autotrader.co.za>','Tata is back with a bang!','Mon, 08 Sep 2025 12:11:11 +0200','We drive all 4 of Tata&#39;s new affordable cars! Top 7 used crossovers under R300k, How 1 in 4 cars sold in SA is a Toyota, Porsche 911 hybrid, driven! Range Rover Velar PHEV Review, Mini Cooper JCW','We drive all 4 of Tata\'s new affordable cars! Top 7 used\r\ncrossovers under R300k, How 1 in 4 cars sold in SA is a Toyota,\r\nPorsche 911 hybrid, driven! Range Rover Velar PHEV Review, Mini\r\nCooper JCW Review, Cannonball run in the Merc-AMG SL63, Best new\r\ncars\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328135\r\n)\r\n\r\nHaving trouble seeing this email? View It Online (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328136\r\n)\r\n\r\nTata Motors new range for SA driven (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328137\r\n)\r\n\r\nTata Motors has returned to South African shores and has brought\r\nfour affordable vehicles for our market. Watch as Sean samples\r\nthem and offers his thoughts.\r\n\r\nWatch now (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328138\r\n)\r\n\r\nView all automotive news (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328139\r\n)\r\n\r\nCHANGAN (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328140\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328141\r\n)\r\n\r\nTop 7 used crossovers under R300k (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328142\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328143\r\n)\r\n\r\nWe look at the most reliable used cars with no more than 50,000\r\nkm on the clock.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328144\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328145\r\n)\r\n\r\nHow 1 in 4 new cars sold in SA now wears a Toyota badge (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328146\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328147\r\n)Some 25% of all cars sold in SA last month have a Toyota badge,\r\nshowing South Africa\'s affinity for the Japanese marque!\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328148\r\n)\r\n\r\nPorsche 911 GTS (992.2) first drive review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328149\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328150\r\n)\r\n\r\nRange Rover Velar P400e Dynamic SE (2025) Review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328151\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328152\r\n)The Range Rover Velar PHEV is drop-dead gorgeous and packs 297kW\r\nof hybrid punch, but is it too expensive?\r\n\r\nRead review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328153\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328154\r\n)\r\n\r\nMini Cooper John Cooper Works 3-Door (2025) Review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328155\r\n)\r\n\r\nThe razor edge version of the Mini Cooper returns in this new\r\nshape, but is it as sharp as its predecessors?\r\n\r\nRead review (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328156\r\n)\r\n\r\nCannonball Run Africa 2025 (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328157\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328158\r\n)\r\n\r\nBest new cars under R250k in South Africa (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328159\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328160\r\n)\r\n\r\nR250 000 is not a big budget for a new car in 2025, but if you\r\nchoose wisely, you can get a lot of car for your money.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328161\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328162\r\n)\r\n\r\nFinance vs leasing premium cars: Which is best? (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328163\r\n)\r\n\r\nFor a growing number of South Africans, leasing appears to be a\r\nmore tempting option than ever, but is it a worthwhile option?\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328164\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328165\r\n)\r\n\r\nFuel-efficient driving for your Toyota Starlet (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328166\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328167\r\n)\r\n\r\nThe popular Toyota Starlet is well known for being economical to\r\nrun daily, but you can save even more fuel if you adjust your\r\ndriving habits.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328168\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328169\r\n)\r\n\r\nWhat it really costs to own an LDV T60 in South Africa (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328170\r\n)\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328171\r\n)The double-cab market has exploded, with a wide variety to\r\nchoose from. We find out what owning a T60 will cost you.\r\n\r\nRead more (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328172\r\n)\r\n\r\nSell Your Car (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328173\r\n)\r\n\r\n*****************************************************************\r\nFind your new ride (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328174\r\n)\r\n*****************************************************************\r\n\r\nBMW (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328175\r\n)\r\nVolkswagen (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328176\r\n)\r\nToyota (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328177\r\n)\r\nMercedes-Benz (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328178\r\n)\r\nAudi (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328179\r\n)\r\n\r\nFord (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328180\r\n)\r\nLand Rover (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328181\r\n)\r\nNissan (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328182\r\n)\r\nJeep (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328183\r\n)\r\nPorsche (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328184\r\n)\r\n\r\nSearch all brands (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328185\r\n)\r\n\r\n****************\r\nDownload our app\r\n****************\r\n\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328186\r\n)\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328187\r\n)\r\n\r\n*****************************************************************\r\nCome say hello (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328188\r\n)\r\n*****************************************************************\r\n\r\nFacebook (\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328189\r\n)\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328190\r\n)\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328191\r\n)\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328192\r\n)\r\n(\r\nhttps://autotrader.evlink1.net/servlet/link/906/1340161/362509214/7328193\r\n)',1757326271000),('19929667f0599ce8','Property24 Alert <no-reply@property24.com>','House to rent in Durbanville Central P24-116372545','Mon, 08 Sep 2025 14:56:43 +0200','Property24 Hi Luano van, we have results matching your alert. Price Reduced P24-116372545 P24-116372545 P24-116372545 R 12 000 2 Bedroom House Durbanville Central EXP South Africa 2 1 1 View Property','   <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\"> <html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" x