OR jobs in Cape Town City Centre. View your latest job matches here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.adzuna.co.za/search?loc=109293&d=25&q=Oil+Storage+Warehouse+Supervisor&se=oorfw_aM8BG0npfoWs_B_A&nid=110664527&utm_source=alerts&utm_medium=email&utm_content=oil_storage_warehouse_supervisor_near_cape_town_city_centre~cape_town_city_centre~hostedapply~hostedapply~~~rec_false~0~10~30~sl6&utm_campaign=Alerts_09_10_24\r\n\r\nEdit your alerts here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.adzuna.co.za/my-alerts?id=110664527&vhash=75bebb27c95f894bdd24f10db5f04c7d9d3b6181&utm_source=alerts&utm_medium=email&utm_content=oil_storage_warehouse_supervisor_near_cape_town_city_centre~cape_town_city_centre~hostedapply~hostedapply~~~rec_false~0~10~30~sl6&utm_campaign=Alerts_09_10_24&autoedit=1',1757365192000),('1992c63b65452148','LinkedIn <messages-noreply@linkedin.com>','Learning Spotlight: Your Time Management Reset','Tue, 9 Sep 2025 02:52:36 +0000 (UTC)','Prioritize What Matters Most ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏ ͏','Prioritize What Matters Most\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">A new season brings a new chance to rethink how you work. Learn practical strategies to manage your time better, stay focused, and make smarter decisions. These expert-led courses are designed to help you be more productive, decisive, and effective every day.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">All the best! <br>Shea Hanson, Head of Learning Content Strategy, LinkedIn Learning</p>\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nNano Tips to Turn Time into Happiness with Shawn Hunter\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Welcome to our <i>Nano Tips</i> series, where LinkedIn Learning creators deliver impactful lessons in literally seconds. In this installment, Shawn Hunter—the founder and president of Mindscaling—offers tips on cultivating lasting well-being through small, intentional actions woven into daily life. Explore practical strategies, such as balancing free time, savoring awe-inspiring moments, and embracing prosocial behaviors, to reduce stress and deepen emotional connections. By managing distractions, prioritizing meaningful activities, and deepening intrinsic motivation, you can achieve greater joy and fulfillment. </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">This course was created by Shawn Hunter. We are pleased to host this training in our library.</p>\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/nano-tips-to-turn-time-into-happiness-with-shawn-hunter?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nSharpen Your Decision-Making with Nuanced Thinking Techniques\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Learn nuanced thinking techniques to make more thoughtful, balanced, and effective decisions. In this course, critical thinking expert Spencer Greenberg provides you with a powerful decision-making tool kit to help you avoid thinking traps, improve  problem-solving, reduce cognitive biases, lock in objectives (to keep projects on track), and make use of your emotions (without being misled by them). Packed with examples and useful takeaways that you can immediately put into practice, this course can help you get better outcomes by making more evidence-based and rational choices on behalf of yourself and your company. </p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">This course includes AI-powered Role Play. Role Play allows you to practice what you’ve learned in interactive simulations of real-world conversations. </p>\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/sharpen-your-decision-making-with-nuanced-thinking-techniques?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nBoosting Your Time Management with AI Tools\r\n\r\nIn this course, instructor Brad Aeon shows you how to harness the power of artificial intelligence to improve your time management, enhance productivity, and achieve your goals more efficiently. Get started by exploring how AI can aid in defining and setting clear and actionable goals through mental contrasting. Discover techniques to overcome procrastination, break your goals into smaller, more approachable tasks, and create more optimized workflows and schedules. Along the way, Brad outlines how AI can help you prioritize tasks on-the-fly, detox your to-do list, and automate repetitive work. By the end of this course, you’ll be prepared to use AI to turn notes into actionable plans and reflect on your progress for continuous improvement.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/boosting-your-time-management-with-ai-tools?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nNano Tips to Increase Productivity and Focus with Lillian Daniels\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Welcome to our <i>Nano Tips</i> series, where LinkedIn Learning creators deliver impactful lessons in literally seconds. In this installment, gather practical insights to boost your productivity, sharpen your focus, and improve your sense of self-awareness.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Join training consultant, learning specialist, and employee well-being expert Lillian Daniels as she outlines tips to optimize wellness and live a more mindful, present life. Discover the essentials of enhancing your productivity: efficiency, task prioritization, time blocking, habit formation, mind and body hacks, and effective breaking. Along the way, Lillian shows you how to improve your focus, breathe smarter, overcome distractions, and manage your energy. By the end of this course, you’ll be prepared to maintain your productivity and focus, no matter what your personal or professional life throws your way.</p>\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/nano-tips-to-increase-productivity-and-focus-with-lillian-daniels?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nHow to Set Goals When Everything Feels Like a Priority\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Sometimes it can feel like you’re working on everyone else\'s to-do list instead of your own. How can you make space for accomplishing the goals that are important to you? Join best-selling business author and consultant Dorie Clark as she shares practical advice on how to prioritize effectively so that you can get meaningful things done.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 400;\">Gather techniques that you can leverage to get clarity on what to prioritize, as well as how to take action when you find yourself unsure of your next steps. Dorie explores key frameworks, including the Eisenhower matrix and the Pareto principle, that can help you become more effective. Along the way, she shares how to find the motivation to get yourself going, maintain your momentum, and make it all the way to your goal. By the end of this course, you’ll be equipped with essential skills to set goals effectively in a rapidly changing work environment.</p>\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/how-to-set-goals-when-everything-feels-like-a-priority-29745089?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nHow to Quiet Your Mind and Boost Productivity\r\n\r\nIn this course, Dr. Yvette Martinez-Vu guides learners through actionable strategies to decrease stress and boost productivity. She teaches effective methods to streamline workflows, manage stress, and cultivate habits that bolster resilience and continuous growth. By the end of this course, you will be able to develop personal strategies to increase your organization without becoming overwhelmed.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/how-to-quiet-your-mind-and-boost-productivity?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nRecharge Your Energy for Peak Productivity and Performance\r\n\r\nEnergy management is crucial to your professional success, as well as how to craft an energy investment strategy for growth and sustainability. In this course, Heidi Hanna—a globally recognized stress and resilience expert and PhD—provides strategies for recharging personal energy to achieve peak productivity and performance. Learn techniques for managing energy, building capacity, optimizing focus, and creating a brain-friendly work environment. When you complete this course, you’ll be able to identify and implement strategies that will boost your energy to deliver a higher desired performance.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/recharge-your-energy-for-peak-productivity-and-performance?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nBecoming Indistractable\r\n\r\nThe world is filled with distractions. When our devices buzz and notifications start rolling in, it is harder to focus on what\'s really important. And yet staying focused is exactly what it takes to get things done and get ahead. In this course, Arianna Huffington and Nir Eyal, the author of <i>Hooked: How to Build Habit-Forming Products</i>, explains how to become indistractable—one of the most important skills of the 21st century. Nir explains why technology isn\'t the only habit you may need to tame and how workplace culture, social norms, and individual behaviors affect attention span. Learn why understanding your triggers can help you react better, and get practical tips for handling common distractions, such as email, and reducing unnecessary interruptions.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/becoming-indistractable?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nBuilding a Time Management Mindset\r\n\r\nTime management is an essential human skill, regardless of your current role or industry. In this course, instructor Brad Aeon helps you develop skills and new ways of thinking to feel more in control of your time and less overwhelmed. Learn that it\'s not necessarily the lack of time that people struggle with, but rather a perception that they’re not in charge of their time at all. Find out how this perception can lead not just to poor performance, but also to stress, anxiety, burnout, and beyond. Learn how to feel more in control of your time by gathering practical insights, including how to effectively schedule your time, build better habits when it comes to organizing calendars, and create to-do lists that are clear and realistic. Along the way, explore strategies to manage information, reduce cognitive overwhelm, and prioritize your tasks based on your values.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/building-a-time-management-mindset?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n----------------\r\n\r\nHow to Get Started on Tasks You\'re Avoiding\r\n\r\nThere may be times in your career when you avoid certain tasks, due to a variety of reasons. This course, taught by Ali Schiller, provides the tools and techniques to overcome task avoidance and get started on daunting tasks. Assess your energy blocks and understand the psychological factors behind procrastination. Create a personal action plan tailored to your specific needs. After this course, you\'ll be equipped to overcome procrastination and boost your productivity.\r\n\r\nSave:\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/comm/learning/how-to-get-started-on-tasks-you-re-avoiding?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-learning_recommendations-0-lil_meet_the_moment-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs      \r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nThis email was intended for Luano V Eck (--)\r\nLearn why we included this: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/4788?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-SecurityHelp-0-textfooterglimmer-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\nYou are receiving LinkedIn notification emails.\r\n\r\n\r\nUnsubscribe: https://www.linkedin.com/comm/psettings/email-unsubscribe?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-unsubscribe-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-unsubscribe-0-textfooterglimmer-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs&loid=AQGggSEYwVBUWwAAAZksY7GcS43HLB31s4McdTH8DvgAozaVVVHS-c5muiE1F_9Umy5ZCQpZUUkzei2Cc6_waRll7qDjXcueWxHn13R1EAnuYb4RuDNlZfBLJv_TU40\r\nHelp: https://www.linkedin.com/help/linkedin/answer/67?lang=en&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Aemail_email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01%3BF%2FsPmGGJT%2BuxrwvCuQx3hA%3D%3D&midToken=AQFb1tRdHVsR7Q&midSig=1HlFfuPa0IXrU1&trk=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer&trkEmail=eml-email_learning_comms_meet_the_moment_01-help-0-textfooterglimmer-null-pxtrqd~mfbs6haz~rs-null-null&eid=pxtrqd-mfbs6haz-rs\r\n\r\n© 2025 LinkedIn Corporation, 1zwnj000 West Maude Avenue, Sunnyvale, CA 94085.\r\nLinkedIn and the LinkedIn logo are registered trademarks of LinkedIn.',1757386356000),('1992c6aa51138d99','Kim at Adzuna <no-reply@adzuna.co.za>','You could be a great fit with WeBuyCars','Tue, 9 Sep 2025 03:00:10 +0000','Adzuna Latest job matches for you Inventory Controller Lansdowne (Cape Town) TOP MATCH NEW WeBuyCars - Cape Town more details » Simplify.hr DC Inventory Planner - FMCG Industry Shoprite Group -','\r\nAdzuna Job alert\r\n\r\n3 new INVENTORY CONTROLLER DTC jobs in Cape Town City Centre. View your latest job matches here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.adzuna.co.za/search?loc=109293&d=25&q=Inventory+Controller+DTC&se=sGYEGSmN8BG3vO3TLyXaHw&nid=103715574&utm_source=alerts&utm_medium=email&utm_content=inventory_controller_dtc_near_cape_town_city_centre~cape_town_city_centre~hostedapply~hostedapply~~~rec_false~0~3~3~sl2&utm_campaign=Alerts_03_06_24\r\n\r\nEdit your alerts here:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.adzuna.co.za/my-alerts?id=103715574&vhash=8c4ef8315c9c56be42d8a825beb8324ca50f503f&utm_source=alerts&utm_medium=email&utm_content=inventory_controller_dtc_near_cape_town_city_centre~cape_town_city_centre~hostedapply~hostedapply~~~rec_false~0~3~3~sl