e, the kitchen gadgets gathering dust, and the furniture that doesn\'t fit your style are exactly what buyers are looking for. Listing on Gumtree is quick, easy, and free. Turn your unused items into cash!\r\n\r\n[ Post FREE Ad Now](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Your Old Furniture Could Be Worth R2,000+**\r\n=============================================\r\n\r\nBuyers are searching for quality pre-loved furniture for their spring home refresh.\r\n\r\n*Couches (R2,000+), Dining Sets (R1,500+), Wardrobes (R800+)*\r\n\r\n[ Sell Your Furniture for FREE](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Sports Gear In Demand**\r\n=========================\r\n\r\nAs the weather warms up, people are looking for affordable ways to get active.\r\n\r\n*Bicycles (R1,000+), Golf Clubs (R1,200+), Weights & Benches (R500+)*\r\n\r\n[ List Your Sports Gear](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Kitchen Gadgets & Appliances Sell Fast**\r\n==========================================\r\n\r\nThat smoothie maker or air fryer you never use is a hot item on Gumtree.\r\n\r\n*Air Fryers (R400+), Coffee Machines (R500+), Microwaves (R300+)*\r\n\r\n[ Post Your Appliances FREE](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)\r\n\r\n\r\n*Gumtree data, 2025*\r\n\r\n\r\n**Check out what\'s new on Gumtree...**\r\n====================================== \r\n[ Browse More Deals On Gumtree](https://www.gumtree.co.za/s-all-the-ads/v1b0p1?product.escrowFeature=enabled)\r\n\r\n\r\n[**Search**](https://www.gumtree.co.za/)** |  **[**Post**](https://www.gumtree.co.za/post.html)** |  **[**FAQs**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/portal/en/kb/basics)** |  **[**Contact**](https://support.gumtree.co.za/)\r\n\r\n\r\nThis email has landed in your inbox because you\'ve subscribed to receive emails from Gumtree.\r\n\r\nIf you\'d rather not receive anything else from us in future, that\'s fine. You can unsubscribe [**here**](https://r.mkt2.hello.gumtree.co.za/mk/un/v2/sh/WCPxRrWByckTgOSQFZh3NGCbwzmVN