e/I0/010201992e0901eb-ae53cd04-3c9a-4a71-9553-d49068b61ea5-000000/jC_osvoteSFE8Pe1X7aKEykJp38=443\" style=\"display: none; width: 1px; height: 1px;\">\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n',1757413966000),('1992e12bc4a51d72','Amazon Web Services <aws-marketing-email-replies@amazon.com>','Accelerate your cloud migration with AI-powered tools | AWS EMEA Innovate','Tue, 9 Sep 2025 10:43:23 +0000','Transform legacy systems, explore multiple migration pathways, and automate modernization AWS Logo Join 10000+ technology leaders and innovators Online event Date &amp; Time 23rd October, 2025 09:00 -','Join 10,000+ technology leaders and innovators&nbsp;\r\nOnline event\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDate & Time\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n23rd October, 2025\r\n09:00 - 13:00 BST\r\n10:00 - 14:00 CEST\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEvent Details\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFind Out More <https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdLqCeZ67irXtksM1QDwMINqNiAZFJlOzqxD0PjhA5E75kUyI0IrAI3-r5QHJ_X-8Tc8=>\r\n\r\nRegister For Free <https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdBsFZzlgH8S-J9xXgNM64FRvhPYrSfk1BFFb9974a1ZuVUA2aTV1TjGGLA2ztObYBJw=>\r\n40+ Technical Sessions\r\n\r\n1:1 with AWS Experts\r\n\r\n20+ Product Demonstrations\r\nSecure Your Spot Today! <https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdBsFZzlgH8S-J9xXgNM64FRvhPYrSfk1BFFb9974a1ZuVUA2aTV1TjGGLA2ztObYBJw=>\r\nFeatured Tracks\r\n1\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCloud Transformation Foundations\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTransform your enterprise workloads to AWS with confidence. Discover proven migration strategies that deliver real business results.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n	- Master migration paths for all major enterprise platforms\r\n	- Reduce costs while boosting security and performance\r\n	- Build smart transformation roadmaps that work for your business\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMigration Pathways and Tools\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nExplore tools for migrating workloads to AWS, including AI solutions and proven paths for VMware, SQL Server, SAP, and Oracle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n	- AI-powered automation for faster migrations\r\n	- Simplified database migration paths\r\n	- Expert guidance for mission-critical workloads\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nModernization Tools and Automation\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDiscover the latest in legacy system modernization powered by AWS and AI. See how new tool automation are transforming traditional systems faster than ever before.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n	- Cut modernization time with new AI solutions\r\n	- Choose the right approach for your systems\r\n	- See AWS\'s latest modernization toolkit in action\r\nFind Out More <https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdLqCeZ67irXtksM1QDwMINqNiAZFJlOzqxD0PjhA5E75kUyI0IrAI3-r5QHJ_X-8Tc8=>\r\nFeatured Speakers\r\n&nbsp;Jake Burns&nbsp;Accelerate your cloud migration: a leaders guide to going fast | Enterprise Strategist, AWS\r\nDr Marigianna Skouradaki\r\n\r\nIndustrial Data Strategy: From Silos to Actionable Intelligence | Solutions Architect, AWS\r\nJohn Mousa\r\n\r\nModernizing product analytics with Amazon Redshift (Zalando): an integrated data products platform for fashion trends | Sr. Solutions Architect, AWS\r\nWhat Our Customers Say\r\n\r\n\"The mix of technical deep-dives and strategic sessions helped me understand both where cloud technology is heading and how to implement it practically.\"\r\nCTO, Software Company\r\n\r\n\"The quality of networking opportunities stood out for me. Between the hands-on workshops, 1:1 discussions with AWS Experts, and the customer use case area showcasing real-world solutions\"\r\nCloud Architecture Lead, Financial Services Company\r\n\r\nRegister Now <https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdBsFZzlgH8S-J9xXgNM64FRvhPYrSfk1BFFb9974a1ZuVUA2aTV1TjGGLA2ztObYBJw=>\r\nInnovate Strategic Partners\r\nAWS News Blog: https://email.awscloud.com/dc/ajD_BapU74vzOhWVQvr7pwr993A-PVrTjB0O_rEx8WJekHpgmf6GDEXryO7LOS0qGrgfDq__8BOllyGJj6YpaCnsU2ewUmgEAEqw8nTR86b7kJsRq_sq7H7laPq48wm4tg32i5GEO-isz3RrlXHJAwju8VSAagDxlyVvMmVobUhVdAG_5DBdA6YNvIF4JYf51Lp8Gfa_wJhWH5Un5pcf43RPFNpy3TS98ZRu0Gt3Hdjd-7C2ujCzTQBQ7FV2C3q6E_ooDEyUqsxoPm41zrGX_n8XaP_SiF_PTlb1rYT7a-QW_v7YZRBGV6uUA754R81crmpOML1bSsU2BaWKNExccA==/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdJiI2_50oEht-dK70sFZUyhJhaOU4yOYkdp0jqsX-256wRiS2ZdzJW11-nwIMULcpaY=\r\nAWS on X: https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdICYd_jU3Kj7JyVhRK2PZEFeVocxr63rX1sl3qIhN6EqnqbwiwtTjWfqAA8MnMp8TLw=\r\nAWS on Facebook: https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdK1I6CKnw_n-evmoUTXhbPGcRgiGueFw6fuFCV7gqqSEAmo44u7CA5MEmA1YfMxMzKU=\r\nAWS on Twitch: https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdOjsykTERnEDtkm7ueRk2d2ozVV89X9dVpK5pjLD2tWykcLNLVekZGQ65h3UQ-J4n3Q=\r\nAWS on YouTube: https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdD79YzYS2xIqZpz0L8-VyG_qaW2F8SE6BCZqM5tguL-aF2kYfbFlSY9Q5J1NNfN1Ts8=\r\nAWS Podcast: https://email.awscloud.com/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdFI6gf3Nl95Ni4e-lsL4pLZhaSVb4R-ZsVTGGMRQ55t3_jI8k84OLkpjmIn4pufTrlg=\r\n\r\nIf you\'d rather not receive future emails from Amazon Web Services, unsubscribe here <https://email.awscloud.com/dc/sRhgdM26bquWWERQj_H99lCavgYp1xy4_-5c9n1WxRAg-Iit3iVTUYZUZlQmzz1BTdI04NvsSqvrTM6rSnQGNK7Z_G6-zH4bcFNO__1cW3u57WO_58NjfoVCgouXqqfA0aerfsPfloirF61gjXTfv-lN4kWkvxh-Y_CsAWtb3qv7LmSau3QAGPcx5cemKRoUTp471oD6mGniIWO3fgZy04l6EG44CnwvFhza5KC3n9HRRGbtvhSqZZGYbP_xgni417hLN-xr1r8SGKo07VlaZxvqRlsYdX0Jki9kLzgg-vEU74lqRW8xmOnQzoemQrV8SpwHv2wpGWH_rrEFuQD9fxR3gEhEvoqXp2Cdb7YP_r6oLgqrVWG0W_gaOGHGUTCMokytjkh-xGPEJ_uv1K-Svbm3G5lYYJTLL5edhDVUlak=/MTEyLVRaTS03NjYAAAGczMLxdJiI2_50oEht-dK70sFZUyhJhaOU4yOYkdp0jqsX-256wRiS2ZdzJW11-nwIMULcpaY=>.\r\nAmazon Web Services, Inc. is a subsidiary of Amazon.com,